# Source art library (1.9 GB: models, 2K PBR maps, HDRIs) - too large for git.
# Back this up separately; ASSET_MANIFEST.md records what belongs here.
# assets/ is 1.9GB of source art and stays out of the repo, EXCEPT the layout
# sheets the hologram pipeline consumes. Those are irreplaceable client inputs
# and only ~4.5MB; everything the scripts can regenerate stays ignored.
assets/*
!assets/floorplans/
assets/floorplans/*
!assets/floorplans/source/
assets/floorplans/source/*.pdf
!assets/floorplans/holo_kartikeya.png
!assets/floorplans/holo_lucky_garden.png
!assets/floorplans/lucky_garden_raw.png

# Nested upstream repo - has its own .git, would commit as a broken gitlink
blender-skills/

# TypeScript incremental build artifact
*.tsbuildinfo

# TypeScript incremental build cache - a build artefact, not source.
# Tracked copies caused a rebase to abort with "untracked working tree files
# would be overwritten".
*.tsbuildinfo
